SF2Player is a Swift port of yishengjiang99/gbk (commit b43f004a7e95321d2decde2e604350b014dcd105:
sf2-parser.ts, src/sf2-renderer.ts, src/midi-timer.worker.ts, midireader.tsx export path), written by
the same author. gbk ships without a license file; this package mirrors that status until a license
is chosen (tracked in TODO.md).

This package is NOT covered by the GNU AGPL: it contains no code from liebharc/homr or from
Packages/omr-homr-ios, depends on neither, and consumes only Standard MIDI File bytes.

The GeneralUser GS SoundFont (models/GeneralUser-GS.sf2, fetched by scripts/fetch-models, not in git)
is by S. Christian Collins under the GeneralUser GS License v2.0; see the app's Acknowledgements screen
(Sources/App/Player/Acknowledgements.swift) or https://github.com/mrbumpy409/GeneralUser-GS.
